"The two workflow levels: the Prepare alerts steps, from the area of "
"interest to the alert set, then the Set up review steps, locked until "
"that set exists"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:26
msgid ""
"The **Workflow** panel holds the steps in two levels: **Prepare alerts** "
"builds an alert set, and **Set up review** prepares its review. The other"
" tools open from the left rail (see `The app window <defo-window_>`_)."
msgstr ""

