"would invalidate every download and every alert footprint. The step then "
"shows \"This project already has alert sets, so its AOI is locked. "
"Duplicate the project (Project dialog) to monitor another area.\" and the"
" selector is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:421
msgid ""
"To monitor another area with the same sources, masks, layers and grid, "
"select **Duplicate** in the `Project <defo-project-duplicate_>`_ dialog, "
"then select the new area in the copy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:423
msgid ""
"In a review copy (see `Import a review package <defo-project-import_>`_),"
" the step shows only the AOI's name: the area is the one chosen by the "
"project's creator."
