#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1379
msgid ""
"Visualization layers support the review of the alerts: a land-cover map, "
"a forest baseline, a recent mosaic. They never change the alerts. A layer"
" is an Earth Engine image or a GeoTIFF. It can be shown on the main map "
"and, with **Show in Analysis** selected, on the two maps of the `Analysis"
" <defo-analysis_>`_ screen."
