"Open the **Additional layers** step of the **Workflow** panel, the first "
"step of **Set up review**. It unlocks once the project has an alert set "
"(see `Integrate & vectorize <defo-integrate_>`_)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1383
msgid ""
"The step is optional: skip it and come back at any time. Its dot in the "
"list of steps is dashed, and the step shows no count until it has a "
"layer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1385
msgid ""
"In a project converted from a `version 1 recipe <defo-project-v1_>`_, "
"this is the only step whose settings can change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1389
msgid ""
"Planet NICFI mosaics are not an additional layer: with NICFI access in "
"your GEE account, they come with the *Planet* images of the `Analysis "
"timeline <defo-analysis-timeline_>`_."
msgstr ""

