msgid ""
"Left empty, it is filled from the asset or file name, plus the band or "
"combination. At most 24 characters, unique in the project."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1428
msgid ""
"**Earth Engine** (an image asset) or **GeoTIFF / VRT** (a file in your "
"SEPAL folder)."
