"Three bands or more: **Bands** asks for **Select one band** (then "
"**Band**) or **RGB composite**. **RGB composite** is suggested when the "
"band names give red, green and blue (e.g. ``B4``, ``B3`` and ``B2`` of "
"Sentinel-2). **Band** starts on the first band."
