"*Categorical*: lists the whole values present over the AOI, each with a "
"colour, its value, a **Label** and an eye icon that hides or shows it. "
"When the image names its classes and their colours (as ESA WorldCover "
"does), the classes take them; otherwise each class is labelled with its "
"value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1476
msgid "At most 50 classes. Values not listed and hidden classes are transparent."
