"When a band holds only 0 and 1 over the AOI, the classes found name 1 "
"after the band and start with 0 hidden: \"Only 0 and 1 in the AOI: 1 is "
"named after the band and 0 starts hidden (transparent).\" Select the eye "
"icon of 0 to draw it too."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1489
