"A standard combination, named with its bands (e.g. \"True colour (B4 / B3"
" / B2)\"): **True colour**, **False-colour infrared** (near infrared, "
"red, green) or **SWIR / NIR / red** (shortwave infrared, near infrared, "
"red); or **Custom: pick the bands**. The hint lists the band roles "
"detected from the band names (\"Detected from the band names: …\")."
