#: ../../source/modules/dwn/alert_module.rst:1520
msgid ""
"Set **Min** and **Max** to the real range of the data (e.g. 0 to 3000 for"
" a Sentinel-2 surface-reflectance image), or select **Stretch to the AOI "
"(2–98 %)**. With the default 0 to 1, most images draw all white."
